            "notes": "ROUND 1:\n\n- The build starts with  [Tactical Rifle](item_683d8145-a13e-4ea8-997b-0ed2151b1cac) as it enables the long range healing style.\n- Stay at the max range you can and focus on spamming heals on your team to farm stadium cash and hopefully win the round.\n- Take shots at enemies to help out with damage as you can.\n- Keep sleep dart for personal protection.\n- I've found the long range healing to be one of the more effective ways of building stadium cash. No-Scope close range healing often results in more deaths, as you're easier to target by virtue of being up close.",
