            "notes": "ROUND 2:\n- Main thing is getting  [Quick Scope](item_c4ddab86-3ae0-4c5d-92ca-cead87dcec84), as you're going to be mostly scoped for healing and damage\n-  [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46), not only for affordable WP, but the effect (double your no-scope bullet size) is also very useful, as inevitably there are going to be times where you're at short or medium range and need to fire off hip shots to heal or damage - this makes it much easier to land them\n- It's probably worth it to sell everything else to pick those two up\n- If you found you're getting dived heavily in the first round, consider getting  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) instead of  [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) to help with personal survivability",
