            "notes": "ROUND 4:\n- Focus on stocking up on weapon power at this point\n- Which specific items you get is more about how much Stadium Cash you've got\n- Because, offensively, we're focused on Ana's burst damage potential, not overall sustained damage, we prioritize Weapon Power and not Weapon Speed\n- If you have enough Stadium Cash, the main targets are [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- Which you get first depends on your Stadium Cash levels ( [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is 3500 more expensive) and whether you want to boost your damage or healing at this point",
